# {{.ProviderShortName}} Provider

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Compatibility

The provider works with both **Terraform** and **OpenTofu**: Terraform 1.5 and later, and
OpenTofu 1.6 and later. It is the same binary for both. The same configuration works with either
CLI; `source = "impart-security/impart"` resolves to the Terraform Registry under `terraform` and
to the OpenTofu Registry under `tofu`. The "Using the provider with OpenTofu" guide covers installation,
signature verification and moving existing Terraform state to OpenTofu.

